  "message": "Great question! Here's our finance team:\n\n**The Mappers** — each specializes in one payment method:\n- **mapper_cash** — finds vendor patterns from cash purchases\n- **mapper_card** — tracks card-swipe vendor patterns\n- **mapper_bank** — analyzes ACH and online transfers (usually recurring bills)\n- **mapper_other** — handles paper checks and everything uncategorized\n\n**The Analysts:**\n- **synthesizer** — brings all four mapper reports together, flags missed bills, spots amount anomalies, and suggests new recurring candidates\n- **receipt_scanner** — finds orphaned or mislabeled receipt images and cross-checks them against the expenses database\n- **expense_reconciler** — finds expense rows without matching receipts (excluding known receiptless transactions)\n\n**Status Check:**\n- **progress_check** — reads what reports we've already completed and how fresh they are (no database access, just a snapshot)\n\nI'm the receptionist—I talk with you directly, route your requests to the right agent, and summarize what we've learned.\n\nWant to run an analysis with any of them, check what we've already done, or just have questions about what we've found?",
